WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.366
Sell more cars with The Motoring Central. Join our dealer network, and your first 3 months are free.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:22.971
Joining takes about 5 minutes. You'll need your dealership details, your trade insurance certificate, your public liability insurance certificate, and a photo ID, like a passport or driving licence. We check your documents, then you can start listing.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:37.070
Listing a car takes minutes. Type the registration, and the details fill in for you. Our free writer drafts the description. Add up to 30 photos and a video tour, or bring in your whole stock from a spreadsheet or a stock feed.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:51.368
Every car on the site is history checked, for finance, write-offs and stolen records, with checks included in your plan. Write-offs are clearly marked, and our team checks every advert before it goes live, so buyers trust what they see.

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:59.523
Buyers also see the full MOT history and the road tax, and they can book one of our mobile mechanics to inspect the car.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:11.067
Enquiries come straight to you, by phone or message. Buyers can ask for a viewing or a test drive, and you confirm it in one tap. And we never take commission on your sales.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:21.003
You get your own showroom page to share on Facebook, and one line of code puts your stock on your own website. Premium ads put your best cars on our front-page banner.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:29.403
Your dashboard shows views, saves and enquiries for every car, plus reviews from real buyers, so you can see what's working.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:44.308
Plans start at £169 plus VAT a month, depending on how many cars you list, with history checks included. Your first 3 months are free. Cancel before month 4, and you pay no monthly fee.

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:48.781
Join the dealer network today, at motoringcentral.co.uk.
